      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Would be nice to just be able configure it per group and optionally have different profiles.\nSo I can just always have few friends in group1 that can always join.\nAnd few in group2 that I change the setting often depending on mood.\nOr maybe option to allow everyone from friend list except some group, like if you have some often loud people that you don't want to see when watching movie.\nAnd profiles just for quick swaps, like \"sleep profile\" that remembers what people/groups can join. \"movie profile\", \"showcase profile\", all with different people for different situations where you might not want some people to join.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
