      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Friends needs to be overhauled:\nBest Friends\nFavorite Friends\nVIP Friends\nFriends\n- Best Friends, Favorite Friends and VIP Friends should all be there own group by default.\nAnd Adding Notes to ppl in VR Chat should be a thing along with ppl having a mini tldr bio when selecting them next to there preview avatar or show status if they have not set a info/bio.\nWe should also be able to Shuffle/Reorganize what Group of friends is in what order as well.\nI Think There should be a tldr;\nOnline (Green) [Anyone Can Join]\nOnline (Blue) [Invitation to regular friends only, Favorite Friends Can Join, and VIP Friends Can Join]\nOnline (Yellow) [Ask Me: Busy but accepting Friend Requests, Favorite Friends Can Join but, VIP Friends Can Join]\nOnline (ORANGE) [Busy; Accepting Friend Requests, Favorite Friends Can Join, VIP Friends Must Request Invite, all invite requests and sounds for that are dubbed down]\nOnline (Light Red) [Very Busy; Accepting Friend Requests but the pop up doesnt happen, VIP Friends Requesting to join pop up and has sound regular friends will not POP up and make a sound from them requesting to join, Best Friends can Join, Favorite Friends Can not join and invites from them or requests are muted]\nOnline (Dark Red - animated) [Do Not Disturb, Nobody can join and all requests are hidden unless you go to your Social Area, Best friends can not join or etc]\nNEW:\nOnline (Purple - Should Be for us to customize our own join requests and also tells ppl when they click ur social what your allowing from what friends and etc, Even allows you to choose specific groups can be only ones to send you requests or invites tho any invites you missed will be in your social invite history and can still be accepted later on if they are online)\nFew of these are new and just food for thought on what they can add.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
