  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like there to be a list of people that i can add, that can join me, no matter what the world instance privacy is set to. (Obviously if the world is created by you, or someone on that list.\nMy gf and i hangout in movie worlds a lot, or any world for that matter, and we would like to always be able to join each others worlds without having to go through the invite process. There are a few people on my friends list that could join me ANY time, and i wouldn't care if they did. Just an idea.",
